every API request or network round

98
00:07:12,761 --> 00:07:15,000
trip finishes below fifty milliseconds.

99
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:20,455
Start code review in main.py. Lifespan
loads the engine once, while the

100
00:07:20,455 --> 00:07:25,000
endpoints expose health, analysis, and
